  "blocks": {
    "setup-body": {
      "id": "setup-body",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "setup-objective",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "目标：理解学习率怎样影响一次参数更新，并同时用预测线和损失检验这个更新。我们只训练一个参数 w；五个无噪声样本来自 y=3x。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "model-equation",
          "type": "math",
          "value": "\\hat y=wx,\\qquad L(w)=\\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_i(wx_i-y_i)^2"
        },
        {
          "id": "setup-normalization",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "取 x 为 −√2、−1/√2、0、1/√2、√2，y=3x。这组输入的平方均值为 1，因此损失简化如下；这个简化依赖这里的数据尺度。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "loss-equation",
          "type": "math",
          "value": "L(w)=\\frac12(w-3)^2,\\quad \\nabla L(w)=w-3"
        },
        {
          "id": "setup-shared-source",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "本课的散点、预测、损失与梯度，和宣传片直接引用同一个 model.ts；图中的数值来自真实计算。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "update-body": {
      "id": "update-body",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "update-explanation",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "更新规则只有一条：沿负梯度方向移动。两个实验都从 w₀=−1、L=8 开始；只改变学习率 α。黑点是数据，紫线是当前预测；右侧曲线上的点表示同一个 w 的损失。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "update-equation",
          "type": "math",
          "value": "w_{k+1}=w_k-\\alpha\\nabla L(w_k)"
        }
      ]
    },
    "training-scene": {
      "id": "training-scene",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "regression-scene",
      "parameters": {}
    },
    "reason-body": {
      "id": "reason-body",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "reason-compare",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "在这个例子里，α=2.2 时误差的绝对值每次乘以 1.2，预测线越摆越远；α=0.35 时每次乘以 0.65，预测逐步贴合。八次更新后 w≈2.8725，L≈0.00812，尚未精确归零。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "error-recurrence",
          "type": "math",
          "value": "e_{k+1}=(1-\\alpha)e_k,\\qquad e_k=w_k-3"
        },
        {
          "id": "reason-condition",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "要收敛，需要 |1−α|<1，即这里的 0<α<2。学习率更小并不总是更快：例如 α=1.6 也收敛，但会跨过谷底来回接近。换数据尺度、损失函数或模型后，要重新判断步长，不能把本例阈值当成通用常数。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "code-body": {
      "id": "code-body",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "code-source-explanation",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "下面直接引用宣传片与本课共同使用的训练函数。每次先记录当前参数、损失和梯度，再执行更新；初始状态也保留，所以 count 次更新会得到 count+1 个状态。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "training-code": {
      "id": "training-code",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "typescript",
      "title": "共享的真实训练函数",
      "origin": {
        "anchor": "symbol:promo/scenes/model.ts#trajectory"
      }
    },
    "next-body": {
      "id": "next-body",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "next-application",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "尝试预测：把学习率改为 1，会发生什么？根据误差递推，本例一次更新就到 w=3。再试 1.6，检查参数左右交替但损失仍在下降。先预测，再用同一个函数验证。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "back-to-site",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "../promo/lecture.json",
              "children": [
